      "extraction_notes": "54 parameter rows extracted, counting the separate Ra and Rz subrows. The secondary header reads GEAR DATA ACCORDING TO ISO 21771 : 2007. Section headings are MEASUREMENT DATA, REFERENCE DATA, and BASIC RACK DATA. The tolerance heading reads TOLERANCES ACCORDING TO ISO 1328-1 : 2013 / ISO 1328-2 :1997, followed by TO BE MEASURED REGARDING TO DATUM A & B, with A and B boxed. Where VALUE is divided into two cells, both entries are transcribed left-to-right separated by a space. Unlabelled pairs are not interpreted as nominal values or deviations. SEE CUTTER SHAPE is a merged entry shared by the three basic-rack rows. CLASS-07 occupies a single merged value cell spanning the tolerance/roughness block and is repeated as a shared entry, not converted into individual numerical tolerances or roughness values. Section headings are not counted as parameter rows."
